  "description": "Republic P-47D Thunderbolt \u2014 RAF scheme. Procedural 3D aircraft model with embedded textures. Modelled variant: P-47D-40-RA.\n\nExplore this aircraft, its depicted airframe and UK aviation museums on Aviation Gazetteer:\nhttps://airmuseums.co.uk/hangar/republic-p-47-thunderbolt?utm_source=sketchfab&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=free_aircraft_50\n\nCreated in Blender with AI assistance. A visual interpretation based on published dimensions, drawings and photographs; some details and markings are approximate.\n\nFree download under CC0 1.0 (public domain). Commercial use is allowed and attribution is optional. A link to airmuseums.co.uk is appreciated. Suitable for visualisation, education and creative projects; not a certified engineering model.",
